  "holistic_F_H": -1,
  "section_notes": "The final text keeps per-model failure rates confidential to regulators and purchasers rather than public, and sets a 5% maximum with a 12-month remediation window during which existing models may stay on sale. The S3 retrofit deadline of 72 months is within the acceptable range, and the S5 mandatory recall at 8 per 100,000 has no transition period, which bears directly on the Ember 8 at 9.9. Overall, every section lands in the acceptable band rather than the safe band, with the S1 scope and S2 remediation window being the main concessions."
